flowchart LR
    D["Device DRAM / remote L1"] --> R["Reader kernel\nData-movement RISC-V"]
    R --> CBI["Input circular buffers\nLocal SRAM"]
    CBI --> C["Compute kernel\nUnpack → FPU/SFPU → Pack"]
    C --> CBO["Output circular buffer\nLocal SRAM"]
    CBO --> W["Writer kernel\nData-movement RISC-V"]
    W --> O["Device DRAM / next core"]
